; An error on a string that spans lines is on the line the string ends on,
; as beancount's lexer returns a string once it has read it: line 6 for the
; string alone, line 10 for the second value of a metadata line. A
; transaction with too many strings is reported on its own line, 12.
"a string
over two lines"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
  kk: "v" "a second value
on the next line"

2020-01-02 * "x" "y" "three
lines
long"
